(F5 T2 V5b: dof_limit with materi_velocity + materi_displacement +
 materi_stress + condif_temperature: two values per dof in dof_label order
 (velx vely disx disy 6 stresses temp = 22 values). Rigid prescribed
 velocity 0.01 0.01, velx limited to 0.005, temp to 10..40. Expected
 node_dof 1: velx 0.005, vely 0.01, disx 0.005 (the displacement follows the
 clamped velocity), disy 0.01, stresses 0, temp 10. Source: Professional
 02-08-2026 probe f5/v5b b_m22 (same input).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
condif_temperature
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 3 0
node 5 0 1
node 6 1 1
node 7 2 1
node 8 3 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 5 6
element 2 -quad4 2 3 6 7
element 3 -quad4 3 4 7 8
group_type 0 -materi -condif
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
bounda_dof 2 -ra 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_time 2 0.01
group_condif_density 0 1.
group_condif_capacity 0 1.
group_condif_conductivity 0 1.
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 5 -ra -temp
bounda_time 0 0.
bounda_dof 1 -ra 4 8 -ra -temp
bounda_time 1 100.
dof_limit -1. 0.005 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 -1e9 1e9 10. 40.
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
